  "notes": "{洗濯|せんたく}する means to wash clothes or do laundry. One of the most common household verbs in Japanese.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pattern: Xを{洗濯|せんたく}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {洗濯|せんたく}をする: to do laundry\n- {洗濯|せんたく}{物|もの}を{干|ほ}す: to hang laundry to dry\n- {洗濯|せんたく}{物|もの}を{取|と}り{込|こ}む: to bring in the laundry\n- {手|て}{洗|あら}いで{洗濯|せんたく}する: to hand-wash\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {洗濯|せんたく}{機|き}: washing machine\n- {洗濯|せんたく}{物|もの}: laundry, clothes to wash\n- {洗濯|せんたく}{洗剤|せんざい}: laundry detergent\n- コインランドリー: laundromat\n\nCULTURAL NOTE:\nIn Japan, hanging laundry outside to dry ({外干|そとぼ}し) is still very common. Many people check the {洗濯|せんたく}{指数|しすう} (laundry drying index) in weather forecasts.",
